            "review_title": "Review at MION Modern Thai",
            "review_text": "Thảo L\n17 contributions\n1\nBest Thai food restaurant in Thu Dau Mot, Binh Duong\nJun 2023 • Family\nThis is one of the best Thai restaurant in Thu Dau Mot, Binh Duong.\nI’ve tried so many dishes and all were delicious.\nMy fav dishes are Pad Thai, Papaya salad and pork curry.\nTheir service also nice, our waitress was polite, smile and helpful.\nThe ambiance is modern and cozy, it suitable for visit alone, couple, business as well as family dinner.\nHighly recommend!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 8, 2023",
