            "review_title": "Review at MION Modern Thai",
            "review_text": "Do T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n2\nBest new restaurant in Binh Duong\nMar 2023 • Friends\nSurprisingly good taste and service.Not very noisy like other crowded restaurants. The prices were pretty reasonable.\n\nTheir Thai dishes were all delightful, especially not too sweet like other restaurants in Binh Duong. Quite enjoyed their ginger craft beer.\n\nRarely is this good for the area.\nWritten May 27, 2023",
